{
"file": 32,
"paths": [
"d002/f643"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "3e399387",
"en_raw": "Know the camphor tree story at the reservoir?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "2bbd5ffa",
"en_raw": "Oh, the one where a high school student"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ee9cd015",
"en_raw": "hanged himself long ago, right?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "873a411c",
"en_raw": "...Is that famous?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "6da15bb0",
"en_raw": "Reasonably"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "11a295c0",
"en_raw": "So what about that camphor tree?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "78bcfd0d",
"en_raw": "That camphor tree, you see"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "3ae59cf1",
"en_raw": "they say it grants wishes"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "4c0e78d2",
"en_raw": "Not a ghost appearing"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "e1498d51",
"en_raw": "but wishes?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "ce854fcf",
"en_raw": "Strange story"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "f8731ecc",
"en_raw": "But, Sango"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "eaec3694",
"en_raw": "this isn't an ordinary wish"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "aa2c9d83",
"en_raw": "You write the wish on paper"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "cb09bbb4",
"en_raw": "and put it in the tree hollow"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "1e207d24",
"en_raw": "but when you do"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "d983fd61",
"en_raw": "you must also write down"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "037f7618",
"en_raw": "another person's misfortune as the price"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "4ead9b1a",
"en_raw": "apparently"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "2284b869",
"en_raw": "...The tree where an exam student killed himself"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "e8ff1dfa",
"en_raw": "...Wishes granted at others' expense"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "6b88ad63",
"en_raw": "Hmm, somehow"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "bde92d15",
"en_raw": "that has some reality to it"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "99d672c1",
"en_raw": "That reservoir"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "54233d4e",
"en_raw": "we shouldn't go there anymore"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "6dd30d3c",
"en_raw": "The opposite"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "ca38aa31",
"en_raw": "let's take a little peek"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "49d94521",
"en_raw": "You get to the reservoir through the forest, right?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "1574d69c",
"en_raw": "Then set course north-northwest"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "f0c064a1",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wrote a wish!"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8973b422",
"en_raw": "No, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "c8d981a0",
"en_raw": "when you make a wish"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "6c729d74",
"en_raw": "something bad happens to someone else"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "7770db9b",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's wish"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "bc8ee544",
"en_raw": "won't cause anything bad"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "c1e961f5",
"en_raw": "Then I'll show Nao"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "35ba3285",
"en_raw": "Yeah, okay"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "c6703705",
"en_raw": "This one's fine, I guess"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "55e78ce3",
"en_raw": "Yay, let's go quick!"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f66377f9",
"en_raw": "Stress from relationships, huh..."
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "f2a21530",
"en_raw": "True, just living normally"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "28e486d1",
"en_raw": "is stressful in itself"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "ba616610",
"en_raw": "Maybe we need a punching bag"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "1e1ba615",
"en_raw": "like that camphor tree..."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "496e7e48",
"en_raw": "Is everyone like that..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "02ea1760",
"en_raw": "The king has donkey ears"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "e87a67d7",
"en_raw": "Even I..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "0d5ac70c",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Wishing Camphor Tree"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "2a5b607c",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "c7988730",
"en_raw": "About the other day..."
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "5ed64ba5",
"en_raw": "I..."
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "3b8f7beb",
"en_raw": "Huh? Which one?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "0ff24ec9",
"en_raw": "Right..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "919f4979",
"en_raw": "Then let's drop that story"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "0d5ac70c",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Wishing Camphor Tree"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "2673c8e3",
"en_raw": "It's the same old Kume story..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "399b4b72",
"en_raw": "A nasty"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "35564c30",
"en_raw": "little game"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "34347daa",
"en_raw": "Even Yamazaki"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "9b3813d5",
"en_raw": "was just there by chance to unwind..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "61472fd6",
"en_raw": "Let's stop thinking about it..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}